# Copy to .env and fill in — .env is gitignored and must NEVER be committed.
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# Then either export these in your shell before `npm start`, or use a loader
# such as `node --env-file=.env server.js` (Node 20+).

# Required for problem generation. Create the key inside a WORKSPACE at
# https://console.anthropic.com — an organisation-level key is rejected.
# Without this the site still runs; the Analyse box just disables itself.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Only needed if your key is NOT scoped to a workspace.
# ANTHROPIC_WORKSPACE_ID=

# Optional. Defaults to claude-opus-5 (best quality, slowest, priciest).
# claude-sonnet-5 is roughly 2-3x faster and much cheaper — good while iterating.
# STEPWISE_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5

# Optional. Defaults to 8765.
# PORT=8765
